  "properties": {
    "title": "Wait... QGIS Can Do What?",
    "description": "This talk will take you on a whirlwind tour of hidden and advanced features of the world's most popular open-source desktop GIS.\n\n*Did you know you can use QGIS from the command-line?* ... or\r\n\r\n*Create a map from your photos in a single click?* ... or\r\n\r\n*Do fuzzy data joins?* ... or\r\n\r\n*Create 3D fly-throughs?* .. \r\n\r\nCome and discover new features and tools you didn't know existed in QGIS and - help you work faster and smarter.",
